        "heading": "OUR STORY",
        "paragraph_1": "In a global supply chain often defined by blended origins and fragmented processing, we choose a different path. We operate close to the source, working within a tightly controlled agricultural ecosystem where cultivation, harvesting, and freeze-drying are strategically aligned.",
